# PT-DENOISE: the path-traced image is clean from the first frame. PathTracing.Denoiser 1 (default at every level): System::PathTracer runs the spatial denoiser (PathTracerDenoise.shader: SVGF variance + 5 a-trous iterations over the demodulated sum / count, guides albedo/normal/depth from the paths) every frame; under DLSS Ray Reconstruction the paths go to it raw instead (1 path per jittered pixel centre per frame, no accumulation).
# Headless shots (the project is outside the repo), F:/BistroFoliageProj, GI=PathTraced, PathTracing.Denoiser 1 and 0, 1 / 4 / 1024 paths.
Дано: F:/BistroFoliageProj, GI_Bistro_Day, GlobalIllumination.Method PathTraced, Lit, camera on the cobblestone street.
Когда: run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.Denoiser 1"; shoot after 1 traced frame, after 4, after 1024 paths (SamplesPerPixel reached).
Тогда 0_day_dn_f1 frame 1 denoised: pavement noise (std of the difference to 0_day_ref_1024 over the pavement) >= 5x lower than 0_day_raw_f1; mean within 3 %; cobblestone seams as sharp as in the reference
Тогда 1_day_dn_f4 frame 4 denoised: same criteria, lower noise than frame 1
Когда: run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.Denoiser 0"; shoot after 1 traced frame and after 1024 paths.
Тогда 2_day_raw_f1 raw one-path frame (the noise baseline)
Тогда 3_day_ref_1024 the 1024-path reference; with Denoiser 1 the 1024-path frame differs from it by < 1 % mean abs (the filter fades as the variance falls)
Дано: GI_Bistro_Night, same settings.
Тогда 4_night_dn_f1 / 5_night_dn_f4 / 6_night_raw_f1 / 7_night_ref_1024 the same criteria at night (lamps, emissive windows: no smeared halos, no fireflies left)
Тогда-вид 8_rr Upscaler DLSSRayReconstruction: the PT view keeps the upscaler, the image is clean on frame 1 and stays clean while the camera moves (no restart blur)
# PT-DENOISE-16: PathTracing.Denoiser = Off(0) | ReLAX(1) | RR(2) | Auto(3, the default at every level: RR where DLSS Ray Reconstruction is offered, else ReLAX). RR keeps DLSS-RR on the PT view whatever AntiAliasing.Method says; its guides are the paths' own (DLSS-RR: Path Guides).
Дано: F:/BistroFoliageProj, GI_Bistro_Day, GlobalIllumination.Method PathTraced, Lit, camera on the cobblestone street.
Когда: run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.Denoiser 2"; shoot after 1 frame and after 8 frames of a pan.
Тогда 9_rr_day 0 VUID; the log says DLSS Ray Reconstruction runs (no '[SceneRenderer] ... engine's temporal method instead'); HDR error vs 3_day_ref_1024 below 0_day_dn_f1 (r13 ReLAX) on the same frame
